@startuml
state LoginState
state JourneyDetailsState
state ModeSelectionState
state FoodSelectionState[optional]
state DrivingState
state AccidentState
state NotificationState
state FeedbackState
state LogoutState

LoginState --> JourneyDetailsState: User login and destination selection
JourneyDetailsState --> ModeSelectionState: Activation of driving mode or choosing other options
JourneyDetailsState --> FoodSelectionState[optional]: User indicates hunger
DrivingState --> AccidentState: Detection of accident by vehicle sensors
DrivingState --> NotificationState: Sending notifications during driving or in case of an accident
DrivingState --> FeedbackState: Completion of journey
LogoutState[*] <-- any state: User logout event
AccidentState --> LogoutState: If not recovered from
FeedbackState --> LogoutState: Upon completion of the journey
@enduml
